    "text": "<p>Identify <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></math> in the following reaction. (Equation not balanced)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cl</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#8729;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></munder><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mover><munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></munder></math></p>",
